
> set.seed(2026)

> x <- arima.sim(model = list(ar = 0.6, ma = 0.7), n = 600)

> write.csv(data.frame(x = as.numeric(x)), "serie.csv", 
+     row.names = FALSE)

> arima(x, order = c(1, 0, 1), include.mean = FALSE)

Call:
arima(x = x, order = c(1, 0, 1), include.mean = FALSE)

